  "content": "\n\n<div>我想我們都曾問過自己這個問題：「為什麼我們要投票讓螢光魷魚登場？」不過今天我可以「修正」這個決定（其實不能），但我能讓它們變得更好。使用這個資源包後，螢光魷魚與普通魷魚將獲得大幅改進：加入大量新顏色、為螢光魷魚增添酷炫動畫，並將墨汁粒子效果調整得更为真實。</div>\n<hr>\n<p>變體<br><strong>● 20 種魷魚變體</strong><br><strong>● 15 種螢光魷魚變體<br>● 2 種稀有魷魚變體<br>● 1 種隱藏魷魚變體<br></strong></p>\n<p>特殊名稱變體<br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"RGB\"</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"魷魚手杖\"</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"薑餅魷魚\"</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"禮物盒\"</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"馴鹿魷魚\"<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"FBI\"<br></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">● \"書呆子\"</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Max 的更佳生物</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/maxs-better-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4JecwoY.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>製作人員：creepermax123<br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/slml9Zy.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/91EJGkI.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b8VtDma.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>為了確保資源包正常運作，請前往<br>選項&gt;視訊設定&gt;品質<br>並確認以下項目已開啟<br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>自訂實體模型：開啟<br>發光材質：開啟<br>隨機實體：開啟<br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/creepermax123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HSH1isT.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%2